Z||000000||FieroMontreal||08-20-2001||10:48 PM||||Hey fellow fiero owners (or wannabe owners), the next meeting of FieroMontreal is Sunday Aug 26th 2001. 6pm is the time..so you might want to get there a bit before 6, location is at Avenida Restaurant in Greenfield park. Directions are as follows :<P> From Hiway 10 (Champlain Bridge) take Tachereau Boul. East exit. As you follow Taschereau there will be a Canadian Tire on your right. The restaurant is just passed the light after the Canadian Tire. Please be careful as there is an on ramp letting people onto taschereau that you must cross to get into the parking lot.<P>PLEASE e-mail me if you plan on coming so I can make reservations.<BR>Thanks and have fun!<P><BR>P.S. Anyone know how I get access to the Fiero club forum... thanks<P><BR>------------------<BR>-Alex<BR>President of Fiero Montreal<BR>86 GT **Silver Stallion**<p>[This message has been edited by FieroMontreal (edited 08-20-2001).]||||reg||6
